	"FriendlyName": "Phone Twin Link",
	"Description": "Loads Phone Twin scans (GitHub sync or Content/PhoneTwinScans), receives phone (PTP1) and ESP32 UWB+IMU (PTE1) poses over UDP, measures distance to the scanned space and drives vibration (PTH1) and sound.",
	"Category": "Phone Twin",
